# The .NET 10.0.401 SDK's apphost creation fails on this machine for every project
# (MSB4018, OverflowException in FileStatus.IsMemberOfGroup while stating the
# template), which broke every `dotnet run` in Tools/, including verify.sh.
# Nothing here needs a native executable — the game loads AICompanion.dll and the
# tools run through `dotnet run`/`dotnet exec` — so apphost generation is off
# until the SDK is fixed. This covers `dotnet build`; `dotnet run`'s launch
# decision only honours CLI-passed properties, so Tools/verify.sh (and
# measure-flake, backfill-capture, corpus) carry a marked `dotnet()` wrapper with
# the same flag. Delete this file and those wrappers together; no project
# references either.
/p:UseAppHost=false
